<title>ABU DHABI: UAE to extend Pakistan $300 million loan - paper.</title>
<headline>UAE to extend Pakistan $300 million loan - paper.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates is expected to soon transfer $300 million to Pakistan in a medium-term soft loan, a newspaper reported on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We managed to get the loan at LIBOR (London Interbank Offered Rate) plus 1.5 percent,&quot; a finance ministry official told Khaleej Times in Pakistan of the interest rate.</p>
<p>The Pakistani official said his country, which is moving to medium-term borrowing from short term, was expected to receive the $300 million from the UAE &quot;this week&quot;.</p>
</text>
